---
// أسئلة شائعة بلا جافاسكربت (عنصر details الأصلي في المتصفح).
import type { FaqItem } from '../data/content';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

export interface Props {
  items: FaqItem[];
}
const { items } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="space-y-2.5">
  {items.map((f) => (
    <details class="group rounded-xl bg-card border border-line">
      <summary class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden px-4 py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-ink">
        <span>{f.q}</span>
        <Icon name="chevron" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0 text-brand transition-transform group-open:rotate-180" />
      </summary>
      <p class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-copy leading-relaxed">{f.a}</p>
    </details>
  ))}
</div>
